Why is the sword so sharp?

47
00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:21.798
What?

48
00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.471
Star Chin, you are truly on another level.

49
00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:29.889
you were so enthusiastic

50
00:06:29.972 --> 00:06:32.016
that cut herself with this blunt sword.

51
00:06:34.477 --> 00:06:35.311
Thank you.

52
00:06:37.772 --> 00:06:39.315
Better take care of the props, okay?

53
00:06:39.398 --> 00:06:40.691
Better take care of the props!

54
00:06:41.275 --> 00:06:42.193
That's it.

55
00:06:42.693 --> 00:06:44.112
leave it I am myself.

56
00:06:46.531 --> 00:06:49.867
The show is coming soon
but Director Jeon doesn't care at all.

57
00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:52.870
But I always support you.

58
00:06:52.954 --> 00:06:54.872
- Isn't that enough?
- Of course not.

59
00:06:54.956 --> 00:06:55.998
It is logical.

60
00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.044
Is there something between them and To To Hee?

61
00:07:00.128 --> 00:07:02.088
- What?
- He is still at work with her,

62
00:07:02.171 --> 00:07:03.548
and they are forever together.

63
00:07:03.631 --> 00:07:04.757
leave it

64
00:07:04.841 --> 00:07:07.301
You know he has a heart of steel.

65
00:07:07.885 --> 00:07:10.555
You are already 20 years old
you pay attention only to him,

66
00:07:10.638 --> 00:07:11.848
and he won't look...

67
00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:12.974
God

68
00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:17.019
Maybe he did look.

69
00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:19.063
I'm talking about

70
00:07:19.147 --> 00:07:21.524
that his heart is cold
like 200-year-old ice cream,

71
00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:24.152
forgotten at the bottom of the freezer.

72
00:07:24.235 --> 00:07:27.196
It's so frozen
which is no longer able to work normally.

73
00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.366
He's not just handsome
he is incredibly handsome.

74
00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:31.451
But all 200 years...

75
00:07:32.034 --> 00:07:35.329
But all 200 years he is lonely.
There is a reason for this.

76
00:07:35.997 --> 00:07:37.748
It bothers me equally.

77
00:07:37.832 --> 00:07:40.501
I have a bad feeling
about this girl.

78
00:07:41.169 --> 00:07:43.838
Is there no other way out?
besides being her bodyguard?

79
00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:47.842
For now, this is the best option for us.

80
00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.265
Don't you need a break?

81
00:07:55.183 --> 00:07:56.684
It's empty.

82
00:07:56.767 --> 00:07:57.894
I don't have much time anyway.

83
00:07:59.687 --> 00:08:01.022
Let's start from the beginning.

84
00:08:11.574 --> 00:08:12.909
Something is wrong with me.

85
00:08:14.702 --> 00:08:16.871
Falling in love with a worthless person?

86
00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:20.458
Is it possible…

87
00:08:22.793 --> 00:08:24.462
is it because of the tattoo?

88
00:08:36.807 --> 00:08:37.725
That is...

89
00:08:38.518 --> 00:08:40.478
Why look at me with such contempt?

90
00:08:40.561 --> 00:08:42.772
He was possessed
holding my wrist.

91
00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:45.274
Why is he suddenly pretending I'm invisible?

92
00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.901
Do I have to put up with it?

93
00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:50.571
Was I the only one who felt this atmosphere?

94
00:08:50.655 --> 00:08:52.073
I bet he felt it too.

95
00:08:53.157 --> 00:08:55.284
So why is he suddenly so cold?

96
00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:56.619
Sometimes hot, sometimes cold.

97
00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:58.955
Is that a hot Americano with ice?

98
00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:01.666
I don't care at all
is it hot or cold?

99
00:09:01.749 --> 00:09:03.292
I'll just go on my way.

100
00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:05.878
I behaved affectionately enough.

101
00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:12.051
SCHEDULE FOR TOMORROW:
BLIND DATE

102
00:09:13.761 --> 00:09:16.305
no i have to find out

103
00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:18.933
is he hot or cold to me?

104
00:09:21.352 --> 00:09:23.271
"SUNVOL FOUNDATION"

105
00:09:40.454 --> 00:09:41.914
Everything.

106
00:09:43.332 --> 00:09:45.793
I will act affectionately for the last time.

107
00:10:16.907 --> 00:10:18.284
I'm fine.

108
00:10:19.535 --> 00:10:21.871
It's just a side effect of losing strength.

109
00:10:30.463 --> 00:10:32.465
If he asks why I'm here

110
00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:34.925
I will say that it became interesting

111
00:10:35.009 --> 00:10:37.345
what kind of bandits used to be
that's why she couldn't sleep.

112
00:10:38.012 --> 00:10:39.972
I will come late at night without warning.

113
00:10:40.056 --> 00:10:42.516
If he has feelings for me
will be glad to see me.

114
00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.311
If not, he will be upset
or irritated

115
00:10:46.103 --> 00:10:47.730
It will only take a moment.

116
00:10:47.813 --> 00:10:49.774
He will not be able to fake a look

117
00:10:49.857 --> 00:10:51.317
the moment he sees me.

118
00:11:34.151 --> 00:11:35.653
who are you

119
00:11:35.736 --> 00:11:38.239
And you? Are you a thief?

120
00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:41.242
I would say that for this role
you are better suited.

121
00:11:45.121 --> 00:11:47.164
You don't look like that yourself.

122
00:11:53.504 --> 00:11:54.338
To To Hee?

123
00:11:55.631 --> 00:11:57.258
- Do you know me?
- You don't know me?

124
00:12:01.762 --> 00:12:03.848
Can't believe you didn't recognize Star Chin.

125
00:12:03.931 --> 00:12:05.724
Then I must be a star here.

126
00:12:06.392 --> 00:12:07.977
Leave immediately.

127
00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.438
Outsiders are not allowed at this time.

128
00:12:10.521 --> 00:12:12.898
I'm not quite an outsider
so I refuse to go.

129
00:12:14.525 --> 00:12:15.693
I doubt it.

130
00:12:15.776 --> 00:12:17.653
I have a special relationship with the director.

131
00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:38.424
Jung Ku Won?

132
00:12:45.598 --> 00:12:47.224
The light is on.

133
00:12:55.483 --> 00:12:56.567
Where did he go?

134
00:13:04.658 --> 00:13:07.119
He did not seem inclined to science.

135
00:13:07.203 --> 00:13:08.787
Probably, it's all for show.

136
00:13:16.504 --> 00:13:18.923
His hobby is
collecting vintage watches?

137
00:13:22.343 --> 00:13:24.011
But why are they all the same?

138
00:13:26.764 --> 00:13:28.224
The numbers…

139
00:13:31.352 --> 00:13:33.479
Nothing ordinary about it, right?

140
00:14:02.675 --> 00:14:04.593
Who gave permission to look at my things?

141
00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:10.307
Is this your diary or something?

142
00:14:10.391 --> 00:14:11.433
Why are you so sensitive?

143
00:14:15.938 --> 00:14:16.939
<i>Cross?</i>

144
00:14:21.485 --> 00:14:23.070
Wow, you bastard.

145
00:14:40.588 --> 00:14:41.797
What?

146
00:14:41.881 --> 00:14:42.965
Why are you half naked?

147
00:14:44.842 --> 00:14:46.385
Aren't you supposed to be at rehearsal?

148
00:14:46.468 --> 00:14:47.928
It's not that…

149
00:14:51.891 --> 00:14:52.808
Beloved

150
00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:56.353
Didn't I tell you?
not expose yourself to other women?

151
00:14:57.855 --> 00:14:59.899
- "Dear"?
- If you do that,

152
00:14:59.982 --> 00:15:03.110
