no matter how coldly you treat them.

153
00:15:04.612 --> 00:15:05.738
Like flies.

154
00:15:07.072 --> 00:15:09.617
Stop and go back to rehearsal.

155
00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.871
You always act cold
when others are around.

156
00:15:14.997 --> 00:15:15.831
you are so sweet

157
00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.208
Then go down to the theater.

158
00:15:18.292 --> 00:15:19.585
I have to talk to you.

159
00:15:22.338 --> 00:15:24.757
That's what it's called

160
00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.884
"special relationship".

161
00:15:35.309 --> 00:15:36.143
who is she

162
00:15:37.561 --> 00:15:38.646
You can't avoid it.

163
00:15:42.441 --> 00:15:44.443
We almost killed each other before.

164
00:15:44.526 --> 00:15:46.946
I would really like to know
whose life she almost ended.

165
00:15:47.029 --> 00:15:50.324
You came here alone at this hour
to pry into my private life?

166
00:15:51.951 --> 00:15:52.868
No.

167
00:15:53.827 --> 00:15:55.245
Simple

168
00:15:55.329 --> 00:15:56.830
you left so suddenly

169
00:15:58.248 --> 00:15:59.500
I was worried.

170
00:16:01.418 --> 00:16:04.713
I just didn't want to be with you.

171
00:16:05.673 --> 00:16:07.549
But here you are

172
00:16:08.926 --> 00:16:10.219
you're boring me again.

173
00:16:14.056 --> 00:16:15.391
Did I do something wrong?

174
00:16:15.474 --> 00:16:17.434
- No.
- What kind of attitude then?

175
00:16:17.518 --> 00:16:19.895
I don't understand why I have to be nice to you.

176
00:16:22.731 --> 00:16:24.108
Anything else you want to say?

177
00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.404
I was obviously wrong.

178
00:16:30.906 --> 00:16:32.241
Sorry to bore you.

179
00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.791
To To Hee.

180
00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:43.335
You made a big mistake.

181
00:16:56.515 --> 00:16:59.643
Mr. Park, To To Hee is coming out.

182
00:17:00.602 --> 00:17:02.521
Make sure it's safe
got home

183
00:17:22.249 --> 00:17:25.002
<i>Look in locker 17.</i>

184
00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:31.008
It looks like the medicine is working for you.

185
00:17:31.091 --> 00:17:32.968
but let's follow your progress.

186
00:17:33.052 --> 00:17:34.720
Nothing out of the ordinary, right?

187
00:17:37.264 --> 00:17:38.432
It's the little things

188
00:17:39.308 --> 00:17:40.476
but I killed a man.

189
00:17:40.559 --> 00:17:42.019
Of course.

190
00:17:44.521 --> 00:17:45.564
What?

191
00:17:46.857 --> 00:17:48.108
Checking to see if you're listening.

192
00:17:49.943 --> 00:17:51.361
Crazy.

193
00:18:01.914 --> 00:18:03.624
- Shall we raise our glasses?
- Of course.

194
00:18:05.125 --> 00:18:07.878
I didn't know you could drink Mr. Noh.

195
00:18:07.961 --> 00:18:09.797
I can, but I held back.

196
00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.716
It must have been hard to hold back
in so many ways until now.

197
00:18:14.551 --> 00:18:17.638
Thank you all for being so quick
reacted to the audit team.

198
00:18:17.721 --> 00:18:20.265
Our priority is the stability of the company.

199
00:18:20.349 --> 00:18:23.519
Regarding this, we have to quickly
to fill the power vacuum after Mom.

200
00:18:24.103 --> 00:18:26.730
I will count on your help again.

201
00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:30.317
Since the will
of the late head was made public,

202
00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:35.823
everyone seems happy
the youngest president in history.

203
00:18:35.906 --> 00:18:38.283
Therefore, it is not so easy in public

204
00:18:38.909 --> 00:18:40.035
support you

205
00:18:42.412 --> 00:18:46.250
To Hee is like a younger sister to me,
but I learn a lot from her.

206
00:18:46.875 --> 00:18:49.253
She would definitely set a good example.

207
00:18:49.837 --> 00:18:50.671
But...

208
00:18:51.213 --> 00:18:55.092
if we continue
allow for such anomalies as

209
00:18:56.218 --> 00:18:58.971
then the world will turn upside down.

210
00:18:59.054 --> 00:19:02.099
Now the world is not easy.

211
00:19:02.182 --> 00:19:05.519
People will not accept anything
with injustice

212
00:19:05.602 --> 00:19:08.105
Nepotism has become

213
00:19:08.188 --> 00:19:09.815
now such a taboo.

214
00:19:09.898 --> 00:19:13.068
We can't do anything like that
which will not be to the liking of depositors.

215
00:19:13.152 --> 00:19:15.445
It seems you don't understand me.

216
00:19:16.697 --> 00:19:18.115
So let me explain.

217
00:19:18.824 --> 00:19:20.659
You all recently received

218
00:19:20.742 --> 00:19:22.911
<i>something from our subcontractor, right?</i>

219
00:19:23.495 --> 00:19:27.708
<i>"The directors disbanded the audit group,
created by the last order of the chairman,</i>

220
00:19:27.791 --> 00:19:30.002
and took money from the subcontractor."

221
00:19:32.379 --> 00:19:35.507
This can be considered a confession
in all your misdeeds.

222
00:19:35.591 --> 00:19:38.427
But you yourself gave the order.

223
00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.428
I?

224
00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:44.850
Do you think, son
who is experiencing the death of his mother,

225
00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.519
will do that?

226
00:19:47.603 --> 00:19:50.063
I myself did not give or receive money.

227
00:19:50.147 --> 00:19:51.273
How do you prove it?

228
00:19:56.695 --> 00:20:01.116
You were led astray
your greed, not mine.

229
00:20:03.702 --> 00:20:08.957
The world has never been a simple place.

230
00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:13.462
If you have no power,

231
00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:15.797
you will be trampled and eaten.

232
00:20:17.591 --> 00:20:21.511
The powerless have only one chance to survive.

233
00:20:23.096 --> 00:20:24.932
Take the side of the strongest.

234
00:20:26.058 --> 00:20:27.267
There is no other chance.

235
00:20:53.919 --> 00:20:54.795
You are right.

236
00:20:55.462 --> 00:20:56.838
I'm crazy

237
00:21:27.077 --> 00:21:28.161
Regarding Mr. Cha.

238
00:21:29.037 --> 00:21:30.914
How much did he work for you?

239
00:21:30.998 --> 00:21:34.084
Almost two years before
as transferred to "Mire Group".

240
00:21:34.668 --> 00:21:36.920
Did anything catch your attention at the time?

241
00:21:37.504 --> 00:21:38.755
But no.

242
00:21:41.258 --> 00:21:44.177
How presumptuous of him
embezzle the company's money.

243
00:21:44.261 --> 00:21:45.679
It's not about arrogance.

244
00:21:46.263 --> 00:21:47.389
He showed greed.

245
00:21:50.058 --> 00:21:51.768
Actually, you are right.

246
00:21:53.854 --> 00:21:55.230
I'll go inside as soon as it's finished.

247
00:22:23.091 --> 00:22:23.925
IBUPROFEN

248
00:22:42.819 --> 00:22:43.779
Why were you so surprised?

249
00:22:46.073 --> 00:22:48.325
I didn't hear you come in.

250
00:22:48.408 --> 00:22:50.077
What is To Kyung doing now?

251
00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:51.078
I don't know.

252
00:22:51.703 --> 00:22:52.788
And I don't want to know.

253
00:22:57.167 --> 00:22:58.502
did you have lunch

254
00:22:58.585 --> 00:23:00.170
Of course.

255
00:23:21.942 --> 00:23:23.235
It didn't work out.

256
00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:28.073
{\an8}TRASHBIN FOR CLOTHES

257
00:23:42.838 --> 00:23:43.672
Well done!

258
00:23:45.465 --> 00:23:47.509
Star Chin, you do not disappoint.

259
00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:49.427
Even an injury does not stop you.

260
00:23:49.511 --> 00:23:50.595
It was amazing.

261
00:23:52.097 --> 00:23:53.932
What do you say, Director Chong?

262
00:23:59.896 --> 00:24:00.730
Good.

263
00:24:01.815 --> 00:24:03.066
I was wrong all the time.

264
00:24:03.817 --> 00:24:04.985
She even got out of rhythm.

265
00:24:06.736 --> 00:24:07.612
Really?

266
00:24:07.696 --> 00:24:11.700
You finally found the time to come
but you don't even pay attention.

267
00:24:11.783 --> 00:24:15.120
You are now like an empty shell.

268
00:24:16.371 --> 00:24:19.332
It has a nice shell. What else does he need?

269
00:24:20.083 --> 00:24:21.960
Then just keep the rhythm.

270
00:24:22.043 --> 00:24:23.837
Are you satisfied now? I left

271
00:25:00.415 --> 00:25:01.374
